IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `qld-part01-preliminary`

-- Tests for Part 1 (qld-part01-preliminary.l4).  Expected values are read off the sections cited.

§ `Tests of Part 1`

-- s 2: applies to all Acts, this Act included; a thing that is not an Act is not covered.
#ASSERT `this Act applies to the thing (s 2)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act applies to the thing (s 2)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 2 Note: the application to a statutory instrument is for the Statutory Instruments Act 1992.
#ASSERT `this Act applies to a statutory instrument (s 2 Note)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act applies to a statutory instrument (s 2 Note)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 4: displaced wholly or partly by a contrary intention.
#ASSERT `how far a contrary intention displaces this Act (s 4)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `wholly`
#ASSERT `how far a contrary intention displaces this Act (s 4)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `partly`
#ASSERT `how far a contrary intention displaces this Act (s 4)` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `how far a contrary intention displaces this Act (s 4)` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 5: binds the Crown.
#ASSERT `this Act binds the person (s 5)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `this Act binds the person (s 5)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
